## Note on the project name

Hood Global Offensive is an unofficial, independent fan project. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or connected to Valve Corporation
in any way.

"Counter-Strike", "Global Offensive" and related marks are trademarks of
Valve Corporation. They are referenced in this project only descriptively, to
state what genre of game this is and which game's movement and gunplay physics
inspired it.

This project contains no code, data, art, audio, or other assets from any
commercial game. All gameplay code, level geometry and sound is original work
written for this project, and all audio is generated procedurally at runtime.
